### SSH Log Analysis - Splunk SPL Queries
### Dataset: ssh_logs.json (Zeek/Bro-style SSH connection logs)

## 1. Base ingest / source filter
index=* source="ssh_logs.json" host="LAPTOP-I0P7FD3U" sourcetype="SSH_json"

## 2. Event type breakdown (overall summary of all 4 categories)
source="ssh_logs.json" | stats count by event_type

## 3. Connection Without Authentication - activity over time per source IP
index=* event_type="Connection Without Authentication" | timechart count by id.orig_h

## 4. Connection Without Authentication - source/destination pair counts
index=* event_type="Connection Without Authentication" | stats count by id.orig_h id.resp_h

## 5. Successful SSH Login - source/destination pair counts
index=* event_type="Successful SSH Login" | stats count by id.orig_h id.resp_h

## 6. Multiple Failed Authentication Attempts - top attacker/target pairs (brute-force detection)
source="ssh_logs.json" event_type="Multiple Failed Authentication Attempts" | stats count by id.orig_h id.resp_h
